Subject: Re: [stan-dev] .hpp as .cpp
Message-ID: <v0PtDkn_ACo.T1bhvenHBrYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <v0PtDkn_ACo.L7mColyGa3MJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
